<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Order Cancelled</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#18181b;">

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#f4f4f5;padding:40px 20px;">
<tr>
<td align="center">

<table role="presentation" width="600" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;">

<tr>
<td style="background:#16a34a;padding:24px;text-align:center;">

<h1 style="margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-size:24px;">
{{companyName}}
</h1>

<p style="margin:8px 0 0;color:#dcfce7;font-size:14px;">
Team Notification
</p>

</td>
</tr>


<tr>
<td style="padding:40px;">

<p style="margin-top:0;font-size:16px;">
Hello <strong>{{memberName}}</strong>,
</p>


<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;">
An order has been cancelled and no further fulfillment action is required.
</p>


<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin:30px 0;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-radius:8px;">

<tr>
<td style="padding:20px;">


<p style="margin:0 0 10px;">
<strong>Order Reference</strong>
</p>

<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;color:#dc2626;">
{{orderReference}}
</p>


<p style="margin:20px 0 8px;">
<strong>Customer</strong>
</p>

<p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;">
{{customerName}}
</p>


<p style="margin:20px 0 8px;">
<strong>Status</strong>
</p>

<p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;">
{{statusLabel}}
</p>


</td>
</tr>

</table>


<div style="text-align:center;margin:35px 0;">

<a
href="{{orderUrl}}"
style="background:#16a34a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold;display:inline-block;">
View Order Details
</a>

</div>


<p style="font-size:14px;color:#52525b;line-height:1.7;">
Cancelled by:
<strong>{{updatedBy}}</strong>
</p>


<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;">
Please ensure any assigned resources, drivers, or delivery activities related to this order are stopped.
</p>


<p style="margin-top:40px;">
Regards,<br>
<strong>{{companyName}} Team</strong>
</p>


</td>
</tr>


<tr>
<td style="background:#f9fafb;padding:20px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#71717a;">
This is an internal notification for {{companyName}} team members.
</td>
</tr>


</table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>